		<Row Tag="LOC_NODE_CIVIC_AQ_PYU_TAGAUNG_KINGDOM_QUOTE">
			<Text>We are shaped by our thoughts; we become what we think. When the mind is pure, joy follows like a shadow that never leaves.</Text>
